type: software
title: "Multifunctional Flettner rotors: reduced-order models and data (ro-pax Galicia, Portsmouth–Bilbao)"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Asensio
    given-names: Francisco Javier
    affiliation: University of the Basque Country (UPV/EHU)
  - family-names: Saldaña
    given-names: Gaizka
